4
00:00:11,060 --> 00:00:12,680
With his worsened injury...

5
00:00:12,680 --> 00:00:15,360
...instead of playing in the match, he had to stay behind.

6
00:00:15,360 --> 00:00:18,390
Tsubasa promised to fill Wakabayashi's absence...

7
00:00:18,390 --> 00:00:21,080
...and keep winning until the finals.

8
00:00:21,880 --> 00:00:24,240
Now, with Tsubasa chosen as the new captain...

9
00:00:24,240 --> 00:00:28,580
...Nankatsu FC had become a new team.

10
00:00:28,580 --> 00:00:29,710
Also...

11
00:00:32,210 --> 00:00:37,130
I swear! As participants, we will play sportingly...

12
00:00:37,130 --> 00:00:40,870
...and fight while adhering to the principles of fair play!

13
00:00:40,870 --> 00:00:45,810
Nankatsu Football Club Captain Ozora Tsubasa!

14
00:00:46,730 --> 00:00:50,860
The National Youth Football Tournament finally kicks off!

15
00:00:51,720 --> 00:00:55,510
By chance, Nankatsu's first big match...

16
00:00:55,510 --> 00:01:01,620
...is against Meiwa FC, another team ambitious for the championship!

17
00:01:02,590 --> 00:01:05,450
Alright. It will be an important first match.

18
00:01:05,450 --> 00:01:07,330
Everyone, give it your all.

19
00:01:07,330 --> 00:01:08,830
Okay!

20
00:01:09,390 --> 00:01:11,210
Nice shot. Next.

21
00:01:11,210 --> 00:01:12,210
Tsubasa!

22
00:01:12,560 --> 00:01:13,710
Wakabayashi-kun...

23
00:01:14,320 --> 00:01:17,480
I must be completely healed by the Meiwa match.

24
00:01:17,480 --> 00:01:20,430
So I'm begging you, Tsubasa!

25
00:01:20,430 --> 00:01:23,120
Our first match will be against Meiwa, but...

26
00:01:23,120 --> 00:01:28,310
...in your place, I will score with these legs and definitely win the match!

27
00:01:29,560 --> 00:01:31,560
Tsubasa is really fired up.

28
00:01:31,560 --> 00:01:33,570
Exactly! I'm super fired up!

29
00:01:33,570 --> 00:01:35,650
So let's all do our very best together!

30
00:01:35,650 --> 00:01:37,280
Yes!

31
00:01:37,740 --> 00:01:41,530
Meiwa FC's matches are about time. To the field...

32
00:01:44,950 --> 00:01:47,460
Coach, it's time.

33
00:01:47,460 --> 00:01:53,090
You go ahead. I don't need to be there.

34
00:01:53,960 --> 00:01:56,510
# Meiwa FC Coach: Kira Kozo #

35
00:01:56,510 --> 00:02:01,090
That's not something a normal coach would say.

36
00:02:01,090 --> 00:02:02,010
Right.

37
00:02:02,010 --> 00:02:09,140
But this person is the one who trained Hyuga-san and Takeshi in a short time and brought us this far.

38
00:02:09,140 --> 00:02:12,990
Kojiro, victory will definitely be yours.

39
00:02:12,990 --> 00:02:15,440
If you win, no one can whine, right?

40
00:02:16,330 --> 00:02:17,440
Yes.

41
