What traffic though.

42
00:02:21,450 --> 00:02:25,450
I've watched this tournament for years, but it's the first time it's this crowded.

43
00:02:25,450 --> 00:02:29,790
Even this single match alone is enough to attract this much attention.

44
00:02:30,450 --> 00:02:32,030
I can't wait.

45
00:02:32,030 --> 00:02:36,110
What kind of talents will be among them, I wonder?

