Episode 14

71
00:04:08,390 --> 00:04:13,350
Go Nankatsu! Beat Meiwa!

72
00:04:08,390 --> 00:04:13,350
Translation: ARE-YOU-SURE
AreyousureSubs Presents

73
00:04:08,960 --> 00:04:14,190
The group elimination matches will be played simultaneously here.

74
00:04:14,190 --> 00:04:18,510
Before the curtain rose for the tournament to start...

75
00:04:18,510 --> 00:04:21,480
...something nobody expected happened.

76
00:04:23,500 --> 00:04:31,290
Nearly all the spectators had gathered at the field where the Nankatsu and Meiwa match would be held!

77
00:04:31,290 --> 00:04:33,810
What a huge crowd.

78
00:04:33,810 --> 00:04:36,550
Yes, a scene that would put Brazil to shame.

79
00:04:36,550 --> 00:04:39,170
There are some fans who know their stuff.

80
00:04:39,170 --> 00:04:41,030
We can't miss this match, bro.

81
00:04:41,030 --> 00:04:44,170
They say this is going to be the real final match.

82
00:04:44,170 --> 00:04:47,260
What a lot of people!

83
00:04:47,260 --> 00:04:50,190
Hey Misaki! Do your best!

84
00:04:50,190 --> 00:04:52,310
We'll support you!

85
00:04:52,310 --> 00:04:54,190
Thanks, Matsuyama!

86
00:04:54,190 --> 00:04:56,310
You too, Furano Elementary, do your best.

87
00:04:56,310 --> 00:04:58,730
Tsubasa-kun, do your best!

88
00:04:58,730 --> 00:05:00,560
So this match will decide.

89
00:05:01,480 --> 00:05:04,320
Who my biggest rival will be.

90
00:05:06,110 --> 00:05:09,280
Meiwa FC finally came out onto the field.

91
00:05:11,080 --> 00:05:13,160
It's been a while, Nankatsu.

92
00:05:13,690 --> 00:05:16,460
Hyuga Kojiro...

93
00:05:19,290 --> 00:05:22,920
You were the one who took the oath yesterday.

94
00:05:22,920 --> 00:05:25,760
Then I'll make my oath right here!

95
00:05:27,420 --> 00:05:30,660
We will be the winners of the national tournament!

96
00:05:30,660 --> 00:05:34,850
Therefore, Meiwa FC will also win this match!

97
00:05:35,980 --> 00:05:38,350
Y-You...

98
00:05:44,760 --> 00:05:48,780
The players of both teams took their positions.

99
00:05:49,350 --> 00:05:54,040
Shizuoka region representative Nankatsu FC is known for their tremendous passing.

100
00:05:54,040 --> 00:05:55,910
They line up 4-3-3.

101
00:05:56,620 --> 00:06:01,670
Their famous goalkeeper Wakabayashi-kun unfortunately cannot play due to injury.

102
00:06:01,670 --> 00:06:04,880
However, Morisaki-kun is no less tough.

103
00:06:04,880 --> 00:06:08,390
With the presence of the giant Takasugi-kun at center-back...

104
00:06:08,390 --> 00:06:10,760
...the goal will be very well protected.

105
00:06:10,760 --> 00:06:15,770
In midfield, Misaki-kun, Izawa-kun, and Urabe-kun form a triangle.

106
00:06:15,770 --> 00:06:21,270
Finally, Taki-kun, Kisugi-kun, and Tsubasa-kun will carry out the attacks.

107
00:06:21,640 --> 00:06:23,730
Everyone, let's push with everything we have!

108
00:06:24,110 --> 00:06:25,520
Yes!

109
00:06:26,320 --> 00:06:30,130
Opposing them, Saitama region representative Meiwa FC plays in a 4-4-2 formation.

110
00:06:30,130 --> 00:06:32,480
Led by their ferocious tiger, Hyuga Kojiro-kun...

111
00:06:32,480 --> 00:06:35,410
...they are a team that has defeated their opponents through hard work.

112
00:06:35,410 --> 00:06:39,890
In the offensive midfield position is 4th grader Sawada Takeshi-kun.

113
00:06:39,890 --> 00:06:42,670
What kind of game will he show us, I wonder?

114
00:06:43,850 --> 00:06:45,830
The 4 players lining up in the last row...

115
00:06:45,830 --> 00:06:48,920
...together with goalkeeper Kawaguchi-kun, will protect the goal.

116
00:06:50,700 --> 00:06:53,640
Look at the scenery, look at the scenery.

117
00:06:53,640 --> 00:06:56,390
I like this view.

118
00:06:57,640 --> 00:07:03,810
Come on, show them Kojiro. It's none other than us, Meiwa FC, who will step onto the big stage.

119
00:07:05,450 --> 00:07:12,180
The first match of the tournament, the match between Nankatsu FC and Meiwa FC, is about to kick off now.

120
00:07:13,230 --> 00:07:15,320
I will never lose to Meiwa!

121
00:07:15,320 --> 00:07:16,370
Come on!

122
00:07:17,070 --> 00:07:21,410
Nankatsu's star Ozora Tsubasa-kun started dribbling fiercely as soon as the whistle blew.

123
00:07:21,410 --> 00:07:27,130
And coming to face him is Meiwa's star Hyuga Kojiro-kun!

124
00:07:32,040 --> 00:07:34,550
The two stars faced off early!

125
00:07:36,050 --> 00:07:38,780
The clash ends in a draw!

126
00:07:38,780 --> 00:07:41,060
The ball rises into the sky!

127
00:07:41,060 --> 00:07:42,180
You bastard...

128
00:07:45,280 --> 00:07:46,110
Take it!

129
00:07:46,110 --> 00:07:47,110
Alright.

130
00:07:47,110 --> 00:07:49,110
Damn it!

131
00:07:51,510 --> 00:07:53,200
My leg...

132
00:07:53,200 --> 00:07:55,700
It's trembling after that collision just now.

133
00:08:00,370 --> 00:08:03,080
Meiwa's ace Hyuga-kun can't catch up!

134
00:08:03,080 --> 00:08:05,710
Will Nankatsu get an early goal chance?

135
00:08:06,110 --> 00:08:07,250
I'm leaving it to you!

136
00:08:07,250 --> 00:08:09,040
Alright, got it!

137
00:08:09,940 --> 00:08:12,050
However, Meiwa intercepts the attack!

138
00:08:12,050 --> 00:08:15,800
The much-talked-about 4th grader Sawada Takeshi-kun!

139
00:08:15,800 --> 00:08:17,970
He shows his talents early.

140
00:08:17,970 --> 00:08:18,930
Damn it!

141
00:08:18,930 --> 00:08:20,100
Takeshi...

142
00:08:21,680 --> 00:08:22,730
You...

143
00:08:23,290 --> 00:08:24,480
What?

144
00:08:27,340 --> 00:08:27,990
No way!

145
00:08:27,990 --> 00:08:29,120
A wall pass!

146
00:08:29,120 --> 00:08:32,040
4th grader Sawada-kun wasn't expected to control the ball this well!

147
00:08:32,040 --> 00:08:35,400
Will Meiwa FC, who seized this chance, score the first goal this time?

148
00:08:35,400 --> 00:08:38,170
My leg seems better now.

149
00:08:38,170 --> 00:08:39,740
Alright, let's go Takeshi!

150
00:08:39,740 --> 00:08:43,750
There's Hyuga-kun heading in front of the goal.

151
00:08:44,410 --> 00:08:45,930
Takeshi.

152
00:08:45,930 --> 00:08:47,830
You've improved your skills a lot.

153
00:08:47,830 --> 00:08:50,420
Misaki-san! Thank you!

154
00:08:50,420 --> 00:08:54,090
Coach Kira trained me quite a lot.

155
00:08:55,000 --> 00:08:57,340
Is he talking about the person who trained Kojiro?

156
00:08:57,340 --> 00:08:59,720
Misaki-senpai, I have to get past you.

157
00:09:00,220 --> 00:09:02,690
Misaki-kun has the ball slip between his legs.

158
00:09:02,690 --> 00:09:03,720
I did it!

159
00:09:05,220 --> 00:09:06,810
No, he doesn't allow it!

160
00:09:07,480 --> 00:09:08,770
Nice, Misaki!

161
00:09:08,770 --> 00:09:11,320
The opponent can do nothing against Misaki-kun's technique!

162
00:09:11,320 --> 00:09:13,230
That's to be expected from Misaki-san.

163
00:09:13,230 --> 00:09:17,740
Damn Misaki. If I had gotten the ball, I'd have definitely scored.

164
00:09:27,650 --> 00:09:31,990
Excuse me! What's the score of the Nankatsu match right now?

165
00:09:31,990 --> 00:09:34,560
Misaki-kun is so fast!

166
00:09:34,560 --> 00:09:36,510
His dribbling confirms his reputation!

167
00:09:36,510 --> 00:09:37,300
Damn it!

168
00:09:37,300 --> 00:09:38,680
Stop him immediately!

169
00:09:42,520 --> 00:09:45,220
Misaki-kun now sends a long pass.

170
00:09:45,920 --> 00:09:48,730
It's served right to the foot of Tsubasa-kun running inside!

171
00:09:48,730 --> 00:09:50,290
That's to be expected from Misaki-kun.

172
00:09:50,290 --> 00:09:53,070
He didn't let Meiwa's defense interfere.

173
00:09:53,930 --> 00:09:54,530
Alright.

174
00:09:57,360 --> 00:10:02,580
What?! Tsubasa-kun changes his dribbling direction and heads toward Hyuga-kun!

175
00:10:02,580 --> 00:10:05,450
Why? He had a chance to get inside quickly!

176
00:10:05,450 --> 00:10:08,330
Is he planning to get past me no matter what?!

177
00:10:08,670 --> 00:10:10,090
Don't be ridiculous!

178
00:10:10,090 --> 00:10:12,540
I'll take the ball!

179
00:10:14,240 --> 00:10:17,010
What?! T-The ball disappeared!

180
00:10:18,220 --> 00:10:20,380
Th-This...

181
00:10:20,380 --> 00:10:21,890
He lifted it with his heel!

182
00:10:24,280 --> 00:10:30,480
What did Tsubasa-kun just do?! He lifted the ball with his heel and lobbed it over Hyuga-kun!

183
00:10:30,480 --> 00:10:33,440
And the ball falls right in front of his foot!

184
00:10:35,440 --> 00:10:37,780
He fired a volley!

185
00:10:48,080 --> 00:10:50,790
You did it, Tsubasa-kun!

186
00:10:51,630 --> 00:10:53,540
G-Goal!

187
00:10:53,540 --> 00:10:56,920
In the 3rd minute of the first half, Nankatsu takes the lead with Tsubasa-kun's shot!

188
00:10:57,720 --> 00:11:00,800
The winner won't be Meiwa, it will be Nankatsu!

189
00:11:02,430 --> 00:11:04,560
A very surprising development.

190
00:11:04,560 --> 00:11:07,390
Despite being the center forward for Nankatsu, one of the championship favorites...

191
00:11:07,390 --> 00:11:11,850
...Ozora Tsubasa-kun, whose name hasn't been heard of at the national level...

192
00:11:11,850 --> 00:11:15,900
...managed to score a goal against the strong Meiwa FC early in the game!

193
00:11:15,900 --> 00:11:21,900
What do you mean his name hasn't been heard of?! Tsubasa scored a hat trick in every regional tournament match!

194
00:11:21,900 --> 00:11:25,200
But that was a very difficult technique.

195
00:11:25,200 --> 00:11:27,660
Is that a play an elementary school student could pull off?

196
00:11:27,660 --> 00:11:29,080
One, two...

197
00:11:29,080 --> 00:11:33,000
Push Nankatsu! Push Nankatsu!

198
00:11:33,000 --> 00:11:37,750
Alright! Then I'll support Nankatsu too!

199
00:11:38,570 --> 00:11:43,050
Hyuga-kun, who Tsubasa-kun challenged, lost.

200
00:11:43,050 --> 00:11:45,340
Because of his aggressive nature...

201
00:11:45,340 --> 00:11:48,260
...he must be furious with rage right now.

202
00:11:48,640 --> 00:11:53,730
Kojiro, when you came to scout us, you forgot one thing.

203
00:11:54,340 --> 00:11:59,190
We don't just have Wakabayashi-kun. We also have Tsubasa-kun.

204
00:11:59,190 --> 00:12:04,700
I'm sorry, Hyuga-san. It's because I lost the ball to Misaki-san.

205
00:12:06,570 --> 00:12:08,330
H-Hyuga-san...

206
00:12:15,040 --> 00:12:18,150
There it is. That look...

207
00:12:18,150 --> 00:12:24,080
As long as you have that look, you won't lose, Kojiro.

208
00:12:27,010 --> 00:12:32,190
Translation: ARE-YOU-SURE
AreyousureSubs Presents

209
00:12:36,750 --> 00:12:39,770
The match continues with Meiwa's kick-off.

210
00:12:41,820 --> 00:12:44,570
But Nankatsu steals the ball right away!

211
00:12:44,570 --> 00:12:46,770
Push, Nankatsu!

212
00:12:46,770 --> 00:12:49,910
After Tsubasa-kun's first goal, their morale is very high!

213
00:12:49,910 --> 00:12:52,290
Come on, let's push! One more goal!

214
00:12:53,060 --> 00:12:53,830
Damn it!

215
00:12:54,590 --> 00:12:55,500
Hyuga-san!

216
00:12:55,500 --> 00:12:57,430
What's wrong with Hyuga-kun?

217
00:12:57,430 --> 00:13:00,460
He's been waiting by the goal since earlier.

218
00:13:03,460 --> 00:13:04,720
Take that!

219
00:13:04,720 --> 00:13:07,590
The goalkeeper can't reach!

220
00:13:07,590 --> 00:13:09,140
Will this be the second goal?

221
00:13:09,140 --> 00:13:10,560
No, it hit the post!

222
00:13:10,560 --> 00:13:11,140
Damn it!

223
00:13:11,140 --> 00:13:12,890
Hyuga-kun still hasn't moved.

224
00:13:14,640 --> 00:13:17,020
Sawada-kun gets the ball and clears it.

225
00:13:18,110 --> 00:13:18,850
Alright.

226
00:13:18,850 --> 00:13:21,360
But Tsubasa-kun intercepts the ball.

227
00:13:21,360 --> 00:13:23,360
Go, Tsubasa!

228
00:13:23,360 --> 00:13:25,300
We're counting on you for the second!

229
00:13:25,300 --> 00:13:26,860
Tsubasa-kun!

230
00:13:26,860 --> 00:13:28,740
Meiwa is defending!

231
00:13:28,740 --> 00:13:30,970
Hyuga-kun is still silent!

232
00:13:30,970 --> 00:13:32,280
What's going on?!

233
00:13:32,280 --> 00:13:35,290
Hyuga-san, Ozora Tsubasa is coming!

234
00:13:36,500 --> 00:13:39,130
Don't think you're hot stuff!

235
00:13:39,130 --> 00:13:46,260
Hyuga-kun, who had been motionless until now, started moving towards Tsubasa-kun when he got the ball!

236
00:13:46,260 --> 00:13:49,760
Th-This is the exact opposite of the first goal!

237
00:13:50,280 --> 00:13:53,010
Now Hyuga-kun challenges Tsubasa-kun one-on-one!

238
00:13:53,790 --> 00:13:55,680
I won't lose!

239
00:13:56,040 --> 00:13:57,560
Take this!

240
00:13:58,190 --> 00:14:02,360
Wow! Hyuga-kun slides... No, he dives into a dual challenge!

241
00:14:04,240 --> 00:14:06,420
Tsubasa-kun couldn't slip away this time!

242
00:14:06,420 --> 00:14:07,900
Hyuga-kun is faster.

243
00:14:10,200 --> 00:14:12,410
T-Tsubasa!

244
00:14:13,580 --> 00:14:15,410
Tsubasa-kun is flying.

245
00:14:15,900 --> 00:14:19,080
No whistle because he got the ball, and the game continues!

246
00:14:19,080 --> 00:14:24,590
What a tough and stubborn play Hyuga-kun is showing!

247
00:14:24,590 --> 00:14:27,340
Did you say the winner would be Nankatsu?

248
00:14:27,340 --> 00:14:28,040
Damn it!

249
00:14:28,040 --> 00:14:30,800
How dare you do that to Tsubasa?! I will definitely stop you!

250
00:14:30,800 --> 00:14:32,340
Don't make me laugh!

251
00:14:32,720 --> 00:14:34,970
Hyuga-kun is preparing to shoot!

252
00:14:34,970 --> 00:14:36,560
Will he shoot from there?

253
00:14:36,560 --> 00:14:38,430
